# cleanup does not have to redo the analysis. Removed on 2026-09-29: the pg-*
# recipes (see below) and the commented-out mysql-dump-data / -no-data.
#
# Judged by how often the underlying command was run, NOT by recipe name -- the
# `j` wrapper only started recording recipe names on 2026-08-31, and matching
# recipe bodies against history gives false positives (old versions of other
# recipes share generic bash lines).
