#   pg-* (7)   removed 2026-09-29 -- pg_dump/psql/pg_restore are not installed and
#              not in the Brewfile, so they could not run at all. pgcli is used for
#              connecting (PG_CONNECT stays: the redshift-* recipes use it). The
#              recipes are in git history if Postgres dumps are ever needed.
